Description: Provides formula-based functions for multiple linear and ridge
    regression. The ridge estimator standardizes predictors, centers the
    response, and supports computation with an augmented QR decomposition.
    Includes S3 methods, a caret tuning interface, an airport-delay
    visualization, and predictive-modelling vignettes.
